{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24720","headline":"玉水记方流 · 白居易","name":"玉水记方流","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良璞含章久，寒泉彻底幽。\n矩浮光灩灩，方折浪悠悠。\n凌乱波纹异，萦回水性柔。\n似风摇浅濑，疑月落清流。\n潜颍应傍达，藏真岂上浮。\n玉人如不见，沦弃即千秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}